  "description": "Sporty, light, safe - the Sonic EVO SX Dakar combines several good features to create an outstanding everyday and touring e-bike. The carbon frame impresses with its elegant design, low weight and superb handling.\nThe seat post can be lowered at the touch of a button, giving you complete freedom of movement and optimum control on any terrain.\n\nDriven by the sporty, compact Bosch Performance Line SX drive, the Sonic SX Dakar impresses with a natural ride feel - and power exactly when it's needed. The rest of the equipment, from the RockShox suspension fork to the wide and versatile Schwalbe G-One tyres and the high-quality Shimano Deore XT 12-speed gears, also fits seamlessly into the overall sporty concept. Whether it's a commute to work, a trip into the countryside or a cycle tour - discover new paths and the love of cycling with the Sonic SX Dakar.",
